    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60299" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρῶμαξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰκος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heap
				of stones</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλῶμαξ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρωμᾰκόεις</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρημνώδης</span>
			, Id.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρωμᾰκωτός</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			Paphlagon. word, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				330.40
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρώμᾱξ, ᾱκος</span>, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
			</span></i> Gr. (?) in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Philol.</u>
				39.354
			</span></i>.]</div>
